msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum "
"business skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "IBM Trainingサイトで20問の試験を受け、量子ビジネスのスキルを確認し、Credlyを通じてバッジを取得しましょう。"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
